      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Verify every claim against source.\nIn-scope P0–P3 → coder corrections;\nrepeat affected checks and review.\nOut of scope → record only. Missing\nevidence → blocked / unverified.\nEscalate after 2 failed rounds.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Verify every claim against source.\nIn-scope P0–P3 → coder corrections;\nrepeat affected checks and review.\nOut of scope → record only. Missing\nevidence → blocked / unverified.\nEscalate after 2 failed rounds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
