      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "After acceptance, Git worker stages\nexplicit accepted paths; commits only if needed.\nExclude private memory, progress, temp, unrelated.\nPlan-scoped skills/config remain deliverables.\nMatch accepted tree; record both hashes; plan push.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After acceptance, Git worker stages\nexplicit accepted paths; commits only if needed.\nExclude private memory, progress, temp, unrelated.\nPlan-scoped skills/config remain deliverables.\nMatch accepted tree; record both hashes; plan push.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
